## Schema

### Tables

#### `admin_users`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | PK |
| username | VARCHAR | UNIQUE NOT NULL |
| email | VARCHAR | UNIQUE NOT NULL |
| password_hash | VARCHAR | NOT NULL |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | |

#### `admin_refresh_tokens`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | PK |
| token_hash | VARCHAR | NOT NULL |
| user_agent | VARCHAR | NOT NULL |
| expires_at | TIMESTAMP | NOT NULL |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | |
| admin_id | UUID | FK → admin.id |

> No `updated_at` — immutable by design. Created on login, deleted on logout. Never updated.

#### `blog_categories`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | PK |
| name | VARCHAR | UNIQUE NOT NULL |
| slug | VARCHAR | UNIQUE NOT NULL |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | |

#### `post_tags`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | PK |
| name | VARCHAR | UNIQUE NOT NULL |
| slug | VARCHAR | UNIQUE NOT NULL |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | |

#### `posts`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | UUID | PK |
| title | VARCHAR | NOT NULL |
| slug | VARCHAR | UNIQUE NOT NULL |
| content | TEXT | NOT NULL — stored as markdown |
| excerpt | VARCHAR | ~160 chars, generated on save |
| search_vector | TSVECTOR | GENERATED ALWAYS AS `to_tsvector('spanish', title \|\| ' ' \|\| content)` STORED |
| published | BOOLEAN | DEFAULT false |
| published_at | TIMESTAMP | NULL when draft |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | |
| admin_id | UUID | FK → admin.id |
| category_id | UUID | FK → category.id |

#### `post_tag` *(join table)*
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| post_id | UUID | FK → post.id |
| tag_id | UUID | FK → tag.id |

> PK is `(post_id, tag_id)`. No `created_at` / `updated_at` — pure relation, rows are only inserted or deleted.

#### `spotify_track`
| Column | Type | Constraints |
|---|---|---|
| id | SERIAL | PK |
| track_id | VARCHAR | NOT NULL — Spotify track ID |
| track_name | VARCHAR | NOT NULL — `name` |
| artists | JSONB | NOT NULL — `[{ id, name, spotifyUrl }]` |
| album_id | VARCHAR | NOT NULL — `album.id` |
| album_name | VARCHAR | NOT NULL — `album.name` |
| album_cover_url | VARCHAR | NOT NULL — `album.images[0].url` |
| spotify_url | VARCHAR | NOT NULL — `external_urls.spotify` |
| preview_url | VARCHAR | NULLABLE — not always returned by the API |
| duration_ms | INT | NOT NULL |
| created_at | TIMESTAMP | |
| updated_at | TIMESTAMP | |
| updated_by | UUID | FK → admin.id |

