### Relationships

```
admin ──< post         (one admin owns many posts)
admin ──< refresh_token
admin ─── spotify_track (updated_by — last editor)
category ──< post
post >──< tag          (many-to-many via post_tag)
```

---

### Indexes

```sql
-- Post slug lookup (primary blog endpoint)
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX idx_post_slug ON post(slug);

-- Filter posts by category
CREATE INDEX idx_post_category ON post(category_id);

-- Filter posts by tag (post_id side is covered by the composite PK)
CREATE INDEX idx_post_tag_tag_id ON post_tag(tag_id);

-- CRON cleanup of expired refresh tokens
CREATE INDEX idx_refresh_token_expires_at ON refresh_token(expires_at);

-- Refresh token whitelist lookup
CREATE INDEX idx_refresh_token_hash ON refresh_token(token_hash);

-- Full-text search on title + content (PostgreSQL native)
CREATE INDEX idx_post_search ON post USING GIN(search_vector);
```

#### Indexes intentionally omitted
| Field | Reason |
|---|---|
| `post.published` | Row count is tiny; seq scan is faster |
| `post.admin_id` | Only 1–2 admins; filter adds no value |
| `category.slug` | Covered by the UNIQUE constraint |
| `tag.slug` | Covered by the UNIQUE constraint |

#### Full-text search usage
```sql
-- Search posts by keyword(s)
WHERE search_vector @@ plainto_tsquery('spanish', 'palabra clave')

-- Combined filter: category + keyword
WHERE category_id = $1
  AND search_vector @@ plainto_tsquery('spanish', $2)
```
